  "2026-08-17T05:14:42.877Z",codex,"Measured gap on 2026-08-17: coverageGate.sources is the repository root, but the gate prunes scripts via DEFAULT_SKIP_DIRS. The reported required source set therefore contains only index.ts while three executable tooling files remain outside measurement; prepare-merge-driver.mjs also violates the TypeScript-only fleet rule. This item remains open and must not be represented as completed by the exact index.ts result."
